AI Abandoned Cart Recovery
What It Does

An AI-powered automation that identifies abandoned carts and automatically sends personalized recovery emails to customers who did not complete their purchase.

Business Problem

Customers often add products to their carts but leave without completing their purchases. Manually following up with these customers takes time and can result in missed sales opportunities.

AI Solution

The workflow checks customer cart data, identifies carts marked as abandoned, uses AI to create a personalized recovery email, and automatically sends the email to the customer.

How It Works

Schedule Trigger → Google Sheets → Check Cart Status → AI Agent → Generate Recovery Email → Gmail

Example

Customer:
John

Product:
Bluetooth Speaker

Cart Value:
₱1,999

AI-Generated Email:
"Hi John,

We noticed you left the Bluetooth Speaker in your cart for ₱1,999. If you're still interested, you can return to your cart to complete your purchase.

Best regards,
Customer Support"

