Portfolio Description

AI Abandoned Cart Recovery is an AI-powered n8n automation that identifies abandoned shopping carts, generates personalized recovery emails using AI, and automatically sends follow-up messages to customers. The workflow helps eCommerce businesses reduce manual follow-ups and recover potential lost sales.
